{"id":"5459c1273ed2da77","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-inverse-image.md","title":"Inverse Image","display":"Inverse Image","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-inverse-image","aliases":["93-lem-inverse-image"],"display":"Inverse Image","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-filter]]","[[93-df-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-inverse-image"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-inverse-image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Inverse Image"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-inverse-image---Inverse-Image\">lem-inverse-image - Inverse Image</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h[|\\mathbf A|]\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(h[|\\mathbf A|]\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\n\\land\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\n\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to h^{-1}[F]\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\n\\land\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\n\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to h^{-1}[F]\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Meet preservation and monotonicity preserve the closure clauses. The structure-specific homomorphism avoids applying the generic algebra homomorphism predicate to flat lattice tuples.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-inverse-image---Inverse-Image","text":"lem-inverse-image - Inverse Image","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B)","display":false},{"tex":"h[|\\mathbf A|]\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\n\\land\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\n\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to h^{-1}[F]\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A).","display":true}],"bytes":922,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["9beeac4373d773f8","3b5f38bd115ed203"]}